== Description ==

'''Steel Bullet Tip''' is an ammunition component in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Furnace]]. It appears as an ingredient in 6 downstream recipes at the [[Gunsmith Workbench]], including [[7.62x39mm Steel]], [[7.62x51mm Steel]], [[7.62x54mm Steel]], [[9x19mm Steel]], [[D45 Steel]], [[5.56x45mm Steel]]. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

